 "description": "ContextNested initiated-terminated child executions (ords 4/5/17/33/34): filter-overlap partitions S0 by id under a start/end child correlated on S1(id=te.id) and delivers the per-inner-partition firstEvent to a subscriber (p00 sequence A,B,B per iteration, two iterations, silent re-termination no-op); filter-nonoverlap-broadcast fans S0 initiations out to every existing filtered parent partition and broadcasts parent-stream events to all child leaves (two grouped-sum rows for E1,6), with virtual time seeded to 2002-05-01T08:00:00 and never advanced; multikey-correlated-term ends only the (E1,0) leaf via a two-property correlated end under a two-key parent, emitting one output-last row {E1,0,2}; category-initterm-distinct proves distinct initiation suppression, parent-scoped termination and re-initiation through the cnt sequence 1,2,1,1,(none),1,2,(none),1; initterm-endevent-projection emits one output-all-when-terminated row carrying context.id plus the named startevent/endevent. Java milestones, repeated setSubscriber calls, the assertContextPropsNested descriptor assertions and the filter-service-count assertion are harness no-ops and carry no steps.",
 "javaCommit": "9e1b9f1cc9117fea4bf33ab043762c045d73839c",
