   "executionName": "ContextNestedPartitionWithMultiPropsAndTerm",
   "observation": "listener; S0(0,E1) terminates only the (E1,0) leaf via the correlated end id=e1.intPrimitive and p00=e1.theString, emitting one output-last-when-terminated row {E1,0,2}; the (E2,1) partition stays open and never outputs"
  },
