   "executionName": "ContextNestedCategoryOverInitTermDistinct",
   "observation": "listener; per-send cnt sequence 1,2,1,1,(none),1,2,(none),1 proves distinct initiation suppression (second A/10 counted in the existing partition), routed termination (B/10 kills grp3's children while grp1's -5 survives to cnt=2) and re-initiation"
  },
